h=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📖 介紹</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>生怪磚控制</strong> 是一款 <strong>伺服器端</strong> 模組，能讓你透過設定檔來調整生怪磚方塊的各項功能。自訂生成速度、經驗值掉落、數量限制，以及更多選項。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>⚠️ 注意：</strong>如果你之前使用的是 <strong>v1.1</strong> 版本，並升級到了 <strong>v1.2</strong>，請務必 <strong>刪除你的設定檔</strong> 以避免衝突。</span><span style=\"color:#f00\"><br></span></span></p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/938u6RR.gif\" alt=\"預覽1\"></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/lUGbNIF.gif\" alt=\"預覽2\"></span></p></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n</table><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\">⚙️ 設定選項</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">探索並調整設定檔中的選項以符合你的需求：</span></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#ignorerestrictions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>ignoreRestrictions</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnLimit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>spawnLimit</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnLimitValue\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>spawnLimitValue</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#dropXp\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>dropXp</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#dropXpValue\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>dropXpValueBase</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#dropXpValue\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>dropXpValueAdd1</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#dropXpValue\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>dropXpValueAdd2</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnCount\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>spawnCount</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnRange\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>spawnRange</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnDelay\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>spawnDelay</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#minspawndelay--maxspawndelay\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>minSpawnDelay</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#minspawndelay--maxspawndelay\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>maxSpawnDelay</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#playerrange\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>playerRange</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#maxnearbyentities\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>maxNearbyEntities</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#maxnearbyentities\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>lootDropType</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#lootdropchance\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>lootDropChance</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#lootdroplist\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>lootDropList</code></a></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\">❓ 常見問題</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>問：生怪磚控制是客戶端還是伺服器端模組？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> <strong>答：</strong>這是伺服器端模組，但你也可以將其放入客戶端的模組資料夾中。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>問：我可以將生怪磚控制包含在我的模組包中嗎？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> <strong>答：</strong>可以！只要正確標註模組的來源，並將它列入相關項目即可。</span></p>",
